                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-santabarbara/recipes-santabarbara/plat-svc/files/santabarbara-tray-location-init",
                    "line": 43,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "It seems like, from your commit message, that these act like EEPROMs?  Can we document what this i2ctransfer is doing and/or convert these to use the EEPROM driver (like you showed in your commit message) so this is just a write to an EEPROM offset?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-santabarbara/recipes-santabarbara/plat-svc/files/santabarbara-tray-location-init",
                    "line": 43,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "HenryWuQuanta",
                        "email": "Henry_Wu@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "HenryWuQuanta"
                    },
                    "message": "Because this EEPROM is a CPLD emulation, the BMC does not bind it to the EEPROM driver.\nWe also do not bind the EEPROM driver here for writing, since it only contains a single byte of data.\nUsing i2ctransfer is simpler and sufficient for this use case.\nI added the reason in the commit message and code annotation."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-santabarbara/recipes-santabarbara/plat-svc/files/santabarbara-tray-location-init.service",
                    "line": 8,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Please put in a `libexec/plat-svc` subdirectory.  ${PN} should always be part of the libexec path."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-santabarbara/recipes-santabarbara/plat-svc/files/santabarbara-tray-location-init.service",
                    "line": 8,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "HenryWuQuanta",
                        "email": "Henry_Wu@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "HenryWuQuanta"
                    },
                    "message": "Changed the path of \"ExecStart\"."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-santabarbara/recipes-santabarbara/plat-svc/plat-svc_0.1.bb",
                    "line": 30,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "Can you add a commit to also move these into ${PN}?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-facebook/meta-santabarbara/recipes-santabarbara/plat-svc/plat-svc_0.1.bb",
                    "line": 30,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "HenryWuQuanta",
                        "email": "Henry_Wu@quantatw.com",
                        "username": "HenryWuQuanta"
                    },
                    "message": "I create the commit moving the services to the folder \"plat-svc\"\nPlease help me to merge it first\nThe commit link:\nhttps://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/openbmc/+/86096"
                }
            ],
